{
  "name": "dsh-app-control",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Restart, update and inspect the DeepSeek Harness desktop app from inside a DSH session, as model-facing tools. Closes the app through a WMI-detached scheduler so the relaunch survives `taskkill /T` and the helper window closing, then reopens it automatically. · 在 DSH 会话内向模型提供 dsh_restart / dsh_update / dsh_status 三个工具：经由 WMI 脱离进程树的调度器关闭并自动重开桌面应用，规避自毁、控制台继承与批处理 CRLF 三个坑。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "src/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "restart",
    "relaunch",
    "plugin-update",
    "wmi",
    "windows",
    "electron"
  ],
  "files": [
    "src",
    "assets/dsh-tools.bat",
    "assets/launch-app.ps1",
    "assets/launch-detached.ps1",
    "assets/run-visible.ps1",
    "assets/list-plugins.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18",
    "dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc"
  },
  "os": [
    "win32"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "compatibility": {
      "dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc"
    }
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/cheng-wj/dsh-app-control.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/cheng-wj/dsh-app-control/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/cheng-wj/dsh-app-control#readme",
  "author": "chengwj <chengwjn@126.com>",
  "license": "MIT"
}
